OL,3,GNEWSADefence firm's plan to turn
OL,4,AMossmorran into weapons factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FA defence firm has submitted proposals
OL,7,Fto convert the former Mossmorran
OL,8,Fchemical plant into a factory producing
OL,9,Fweapons components.
OL,11,FThe Fife Ethylene Plant near
OL,12,FCowdenbeath ceased production in
OL,13,FFebruary after 40 years as its owner
OL,14,FExxonMobil said it was no longer
OL,15,Ffinancially viable.
OL,17,FMore than 400 staff were affected by
OL,18,Fthe closure. The energy giant said it
OL,19,Fanticipates it will take until 2028 to
OL,20,Ffully decommission the site and and
OL,21,Fmake it safe for dismantling.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
