OL,3,GNEWSADefence firm's plan to turn
OL,4,AMossmorran into weapons factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, defence contractor TBG
OL,7,FInternational Limited submitted a
OL,8,Fpre-application screening request to
OL,9,FFife Council for the conversion of the
OL,10,Fsite into an "energetics manufacturing
OL,11,Ffacility".
